><img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_image21.png\" width=\"126\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["99年第一次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800599","s":"若　a　為方程式（x－<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r166.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＝100　的一根，b　為方程式（y－4）<sup>2</sup>＝17　的一根，且　a、b　都是正數，則　a－b　之值為何？【99　年第　1　次基測】","o":["5","6","<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r167.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">","10－<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r168.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":1,"e":"x－<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r169.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">＝±　10，x＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r170.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">　±　10　∴a＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r171.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">＋10<br>y－4＝±　<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r172.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">，y＝4　±　<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r173.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\">　∴b＝4＋<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r174.svg\" width=\"32\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>a－b＝10－4＝6","k":["99年第一次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800600","s":"坐標平面上，若移動二次函數　y＝2（x－175）（x－176）＋6　的圖形，使其與　x　軸交於兩點，且此兩點的距離為　1　單位，則移動方式可為下列哪一種？【99　年第　1　次基測】","o":["向上移動　3　單位","向下移動　3　單位","向上移動　6　單位","向下移動　6　單位"],"a":3,"e":"y－6＝2（x－175）（x－176）<br>當　y＝6　時，x＝175　或　176<br>即此函數與直線　y＝6<br>交於A（175，6）、B（176，6）兩點，且<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r175.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1<br>∴下移　6　單位即可與　x　軸交於兩點，且兩點距離為　1　單位<br><img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_image22.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"226\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["99年第一次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800601","s":"如圖，直線 CP 是<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r177.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的中垂線且交<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r178.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">於 P，其中<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r179.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r180.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">。甲、乙兩人想在<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r181.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上取兩點 D、E，使得<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r182.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r183.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r184.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r185.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">，其作法如下：<br>(甲)作∠ACP、∠BCP 之角平分線，分別交<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r186.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">於 D、E，則 D、E 即為所求<br>(乙)作<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r187.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r188.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">之中垂線，分別交<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r189.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">於 D、E，則 D、E 即為所求<br>對於甲、乙兩人的作法，下列判斷何者正確？<br><img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_image23.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"167\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["兩人都正確","兩人都錯誤","甲正確，乙錯誤","甲錯誤，乙正確"],"a":3,"e":"(甲)(１)作<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r191.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r192.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，又∠1＝∠2<br>∴△CDG <img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r193.svg\" width=\"19\" alt=\"附圖\">△CDP（RHS） <img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r194.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"> <img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r195.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r196.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(２)令<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r197.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r198.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1，<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r199.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2<br>則<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r200.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r201.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r202.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r203.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">－1<br>∴<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r204.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">≠<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r205.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，即△ACD 不為等腰三角形<br>因此<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r206.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">≠<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r207.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，不滿足題意<br><img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_image24.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"166\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(乙)∵D 在<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r209.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的中垂線上　∴<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r210.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r211.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵E 在<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r212.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的中垂線上　∴<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r213.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r214.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵C 在<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r215.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的中垂線上　∴<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r216.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r217.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>又∠ACD＝∠A＝∠B＝∠BCE<br>∴△ACD <img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r218.svg\" width=\"19\" alt=\"附圖\">△BCE（ASA） <img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r219.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\"> <img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r220.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r221.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r222.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r223.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_image25.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"168\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["99年第一次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800602","s":"如圖(一)，扇形　AOB　中，<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r225.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝10，∠AOB＝36°。若固定　B　點，將此扇形依順時針方向旋轉，得一新扇形　A&#x27;O&#x27;B，其中　A　點在<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r226.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">上，如圖(二)所示，則　O　點旋轉至　O&#x27;　點所經過的軌跡長度為何？【99　年第　1　次基測】<br><table class=\"qt\"><tr><td><img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_image26.png\" width=\"110\" alt=\"附圖\">　　<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_image27.png\" width=\"146\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>　　圖(一)　　　　　　　圖(二)</td></tr></table>","o":["π","2π","3π","4π"],"a":3,"e":"","k":["99年第一次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800603","s":"甲、乙兩種機器分別以固定速率生產一批貨物，若　4　台甲機器和　2　台乙機器同時運轉　3　小時的總產量，與　2　台甲機器和　5　台乙機器同時運轉　2　小時的總產量相同，則　1　台甲機器運轉　1　小時的產量，與　1　台乙機器運轉幾小時的產量相同？【99　年第　1　次基測】","o":["<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r231.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r232.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/33c4eb_y99-1_r233.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">","2"],"a":0,"e":"設每台甲機器每小時產量為　x<br>每台乙機器每小時產量為　y<br>3（4x＋2y）＝2（2x＋5y）<br>12x＋6y＝4x＋10y<br>8x＝4y，2x＝y　∴x：y＝1：2<br>時間比＝<img sr